  "name": "Curtain Step & Veil Transposition",
  "description": "§e§lCurtain Step:§r\nPress your Primary Ability key to throw a harmless veil pearl. Curtain Step has a 3-second cooldown and grants §c§l[Reality Shatter]§r for 15 seconds. Using Curtain Step again while Reality Shatter is active extends it by 10 seconds, up to 2 minutes.\n \n§e§lVeil Transposition:§r\nSneak and press your Primary Ability key while looking at a creature within 32 blocks to exchange positions with it and apply §c§l[Reality Shatter]§r to the target for 5 seconds."
}
